    "zh": "膝盖伸直不动，腿往前抬",
    "en": "Knee straight, lift the leg forward"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue2",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "上身别往后仰，椅子只用来扶。",
    "en": "Don't lean back. The chair is just for balance."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue3",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "慢慢放回，膝盖别绷死。",
    "en": "Lower slowly without locking your knee."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue4",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "一边做完，绑带换到另一只脚，转过身再做。",
    "en": "When one side is done, move the strap to the other ankle and turn around."
   }
  }
 ],
